*>   2003-12-04 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 769
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PENNIGHT STEP060
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0001.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY PEN0001C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 LATE-CHARGE        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM ASSESS-PENALTY
    DISPLAY "LATE-CHARGE=" LATE-CHARGE
    STOP RUN.
ASSESS-PENALTY.
    EVALUATE DAYS-PAST-DUE
        WHEN 1 THRU 15
            MOVE 15 TO LATE-CHARGE
        *> LATE PAYMENT FEE
        WHEN 16 THRU 30
            MOVE 35 TO LATE-CHARGE
        *> SERIOUSLY LATE PAYMENT PENALTY
        WHEN 31 THRU 999
            COMPUTE LATE-CHARGE = BALANCE-DUE * 0.05
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 0 TO LATE-CHARGE
    END-EVALUATE.
